      hu: ["Boa Vista szigetének egykori fővárosa", "Lakossága körülbelül 1200 fő", "Híres a hagyományos fazekasműhelyéről", "Az Aristides Pereira repülőtér (BVC) mellett fekszik", "Itt található a sziget legidősebb temploma (São Roque)", "A Ribeira do Rabil folyó torkolatánál található"],
      ro: ["Fosta capitală a insulei Boa Vista", "Populație de aproximativ 1.200 de locuitori", "Renumit pentru școala de olărit tradițional", "Situat lângă Aeroportul Aristides Pereira (BVC)", "Găzduiește cea mai veche biserică de pe insulă (São Roque)", "Localizat la gura de vărsare a Ribeira do Rabil"],
      en: ["Former capital city of Boa Vista", "Population of approximately 1,200 inhabitants", "Famous for its traditional pottery workshop", "Adjacent to Aristides Pereira Airport (BVC)", "Home to the island's oldest church (São Roque)", "Situated at the mouth of the Ribeira do Rabil"],
